# Secrets. Never ship a local environment file, even though pub already skips
# dotfiles, so that the intent is explicit and survives future pub changes.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
example/.env

# A .pubignore makes `dart pub publish` ignore .gitignore entirely, so every
# non-hidden path .gitignore was keeping out of the archive has to be repeated
# here. Without this the archive grows from ~124 KB to ~14 MB, because
# example/build ships.
build/
**/build/
example/build/
